              </p>

              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="deadline">Deadline: Aug 27, 2026</span>
                <a href="/jobs/accountant-hawassa-124" class="details-btn">
                  View job →
                </a>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="listing-card">
              <div class="listing-top">
                <div class="company-logo">NG</div>
                <span class="badge">Contract</span>
              </div>

              <h3>
                <a href="/jobs/project-officer-addis-ababa-125">
