                </a>
              </h3>

              <div class="company">NGO Ethiopia</div>

              <div class="meta">
                <span>📍 Addis Ababa</span>
                <span>💼 NGO</span>
              </div>

              <p class="listing-description">
                Coordinate project activities, reporting, stakeholder
